# Concept: the green that lies

#>spw_concept_green_that_lies
#:concept =contested

^"card"{
  ~#what: "the taxonomy of false assurance: a suite named soundness certifying a MOCK; a ratchet that cannot compile; a false cognate (a PROVER that proves nothing); self-consistent theater (verify functions checking their own output); a gate no remote actually runs"
  ~#why_hard: "every specimen is green; the taxonomy exists because each kind needs a different antibody — renaming, arming, rigging, or wiring"
  ~#exemplar: "MCP submit-turn DROPS the effects array — a green that lies, still open at mining time"
  ~#stitches: "greens_that_mean_something lane ↔ praxis.antibodies ↔ vacuity (its purest species) ↔ chronicle.teeth campaign"
  ~#trap: "auditing by color — the whole concept is that color is the thing being forged"
}
